  m_Text: "<b><size=30>LIGHT SHADOW \u2014 Credits</size></b>\r\n\r\nThis document
    is generated from Docs/ASSET_LICENSES.md (the asset license\r\nregistry). Do
    not edit credit lines here directly \u2014 update the registry, then\r\nregenerate
    this file. Registry verified 2026-10-30/31; credits generated\r\n2026-11-19.
    CC0 entries require no attribution but are credited here anyway.\r\n\r\nThe in-game
    credits screen (Phase 4, Docs/TASKS.md) renders from this file.\r\n\r\n\n<b>3D
    models \u2014 Kenney (CC0 1.0, kenney.nl)</b>\r\n\r\n\u2022 Kenney <b>Furniture
    Kit</b> \u2014 desks, chairs, bookcases, cabinets, benches,\r\n  rugs, boxes
    (classroom/library/staff/entrance props).\r\n\u2022 Kenney <b>Nature Kit</b>
    \u2014 bushes, planter foliage, garden trees.\r\n\u2022 Kenney <b>Graveyard Kit</b>
    \u2014 lightposts, iron fence segments, pines\r\n  (forecourt/garden dressing).\r\n\u2022
    Kenney <b>Blocky Characters</b> \u2014 imported for the Shadow silhouette; since\r\n 
    replaced in-engine by the procedural SM_Wraith mesh (kept credited per the\r\n 
    registry).\r\n\r\n\n<b>Textures \u2014 Poly Haven (CC0 1.0, polyhaven.com)</b>\r\n\r\n\u2022
    <b>grey_plaster</b> by Rob Tuytel \u2014 walls, lintels, ceiling.\r\n\u2022 <b>old_wood_floor</b>
    by Guillaume Monsergent \u2014 school floor, stage.\r\n\u2022 <b>floor_tiles_02</b>
    by Rob Tuytel \u2014 corridor tile.\r\n\u2022 <b>brushed_concrete</b> by Dario
    Barresi, Dimitrios Savva \u2014 concrete, stone\r\n  planters, ending pillars.\r\n\u2022
    <b>metal_plate_02</b> by Rob Tuytel \u2014 lockers, lab benches, exit-gate metal.\r\n\u2022
    <b>dark_paneled_wood</b> by Dimitrios Savva \u2014 chalkboard frames, door wood.\r\n\u2022
    <b>leafy_grass</b> by Charlotte Baglioni \u2014 garden ground.\r\n\u2022 <b>quatrefoil_jacquard_fabric</b>
    by colormass, Rico Cilliers \u2014 stage\r\n  backdrop fabric.\r\n\r\n\n<b>Audio
    \u2014 sound effects</b>\r\n\r\n\u2022 <b>qubodup \u2014 Ghost Moans</b> (CC0
    1.0) \u2014 The Shadow's voice: patrol/chase/\r\n  stinger moans (SFX_ShadowMoan_0..2).\r\n\r\n\u2022
    Kenney <b>Interface Sounds</b> (CC0 1.0) \u2014 quiz correct/wrong, clicks, pickups.\r\n\r\n\u2022
    Kenney <b>Impact Sounds</b> (CC0 1.0) \u2014 footstep sets by surface, fuse power\r\n 
    hit.\r\n\u2022 Kenney <b>RPG Audio</b> (CC0 1.0) \u2014 door creak.\r\n\r\n\n<b>Audio
    \u2014 ambience</b>\r\n\r\n\u2022 <b>Abandoned Building Ambience</b> by <b>tcarisland</b>
    \u2014 school-at-night\r\n  ambience loop (AMB_SchoolNight).\r\n  License: CC-BY
    3.0 ( \u2014\r\n  attribution required.\r\n  Source: \u2014\r\n  Author: tcarisland
    (\r\n\r\n  > Abandoned Building Ambience \u2014\r\n  > License: CC-BY 3.0 ( \u2014
    attribution REQUIRED.\r\n  > Author: tcarisland (\r\n  > Used in LIGHT SHADOW
    as AMB_SchoolNight (school-at-night ambience loop).\r\n  > Downloaded 2026-10-31.
    File: abandonedbuildingambience2.wav (loopable recording).\r\n\r\n\n<b>Technology</b>\r\n\r\n\u2022
    <b>Made with Unity</b> \u2014 Unity 6000.4.0f1 with the Universal Render Pipeline.\r\n\u2022
    <b>Blender</b> \u2014 planned hero-prop and architecture pass\r\n  (Docs/TASKS.md
    P2); Art/ pipeline tooling.\r\n\r\n\n<b>Fonts</b>\r\n\r\nBundled OFL/Apache font
    set (Assets/_Project/Fonts/, license texts shipped in\r\nAssets/_Project/Fonts/Licenses/
    \u2014 registry: Docs/ASSET_LICENSES.md):\r\n\r\n\u2022 <b>Noto Naskh Arabic</b>
    Regular + Bold (SIL OFL 1.1) by The Noto Project Authors \u2014 Arabic body\r\n 
    text and Arabic titles (the only bundled font covering the Arabic Presentation
    Forms-B range the\r\n  display-time shaper emits).\r\n\u2022 <b>Cairo</b> Regular
    + Bold (SIL OFL 1.1) by The Cairo Project Authors \u2014 Latin titles (Bold)
    and\r\n  first Latin UI fallback.\r\n\u2022 <b>Inter</b> Regular + SemiBold (SIL
    OFL 1.1) by The Inter Project Authors \u2014 Latin body/UI font.\r\n\r\n\u2022
    <b>Reem Kufi</b> Regular + Bold (SIL OFL 1.1, Reserved Font Name) by The Reem
    Kufi Project Authors\r\n  \u2014 bundled display alternative (not yet bound in
    UI).\r\n\u2022 <b>Special Elite</b> Regular (Apache License 2.0) by Astigmatic
    \u2014 typewriter notes/props\r\n  (Latin-only).\r\n\r\n\n<b>Music</b>\r\n\r\n\u2022
    <b>Kevin MacLeod</b> (incompetech.com), CC-BY 3.0 \u2014 required attribution
    (versions confirmed on the\r\n  Wikimedia Commons file pages for each ISRC at
    download time, 2026-11-19):\r\n\r\n  > \"Long Note One\" Kevin MacLeod (incompetech.com)\r\n 
    > Licensed under Creative Commons: By Attribution 3.0\r\n  > \"Frozen Star\"
    Kevin MacLeod (incompetech.com)\r\n  > Licensed under Creative Commons: By Attribution
    3.0\r\n  > \"Anguish\" Kevin MacLeod (incompetech.com)\r\n  > Licensed under
    Creative Commons: By Attribution 3.0\r\n\r\n  Used as: \"Long Note One\" \u2014
    night-school tension bed layered under the procedural AdaptiveMusic\r\n  pads
    (Explore/Stalk); \"Frozen Star\" \u2014 FullRecovery ending cue (MUS_Ending_HopeGold);
    \"Anguish\" \u2014\r\n  Dawnless ending cue (MUS_Ending_DawnlessGrey). Track
    pages:\r\n \xB7 USUAN1100356 \xB7\r\n  USUAN1400047.\r\n\u2022 <b>Procedural
    layers</b> (AdaptiveMusic synthesised calm/tension/pulse pads) \u2014 original,\r\n 
    no third-party rights. The Pixabay primaries from Docs/SOURCING_FONTS_MUSIC.md
    remain pending\r\n  manual download; they will be logged in Docs/ASSET_LICENSES.md
    and credited here when adopted.\r\n\r\n\n<b>Team</b>\r\n\r\n\u2022 <b>LIGHT SHADOW</b>
    by the <b>LightShadow Team</b>.\r\n"
